# The functions of Mission_FaceTheMayor in level downtown (the script levels/downtown/scripts/mission_facethemayor.py of Data.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: GetMayorProfile, InitStatus, Init, PreLaunchTaunt, LaunchMayorInitialTaunt, CreateCrazyMayor, MayorOnDeath, SetPhoneCab, UsePhoneCab, EndOfMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/downtown/mission_facethemayor.def replaces this file.
section FleeFromPolice
call SaveGame.MMDesc "Mission_TalkToDeepThroat1_MissionText1" 1

section SetAlarmCallback status
call Speech.AddRemoteCom "Mission_TalkToDeepThroat1_RemoteMessage1" "DeepThroat"
call SaveGame.QWayPoint
